@page "/"
<PageTitle>gpsTrainer</PageTitle>
<section class="home">
    <img class="home-mark" src="images/gpstrainer-icon.svg" alt="GPS Trainer" width="72" height="72" />
    <h1>Endurance sports software</h1>
    <a class="home-link" href="about">What is gpsTrainer?</a>
    <p class="home-lead">This race proven system lets you define and race your own courses, or download courses and race against times that are already logged. Set speed and pace goals and hear where you are against those goals.</p>
    <p>gpsTrainer keeps track of distance, elapsed time, average pace, average speed, and altitude gained. It tells you if you are ahead or behind your goal, and by how much, at the checkpoint intervals you set.</p>
    <div class="home-cards">
        <div class="home-card">
            <a href="truepace">TruePace</a>
            <p>technology is part of the training program for cycling, running, and cross-country skiing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="home-card">
            <a href="generate">Generate a Fort Collins cycling loop</a>
            <p>from the paved trail corridors and on-road bike lanes.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
